flowchart TD
    Routes["Routes: auth, typed validation, deadline, full ASGI timer"] --> Router["Bounded EN/VI classifier và AST parser"]
    Router --> Fast["Single-vector fast path hoặc safe fallback"]
    Router --> Advanced["Multi-intent / paired advanced retrieval"]
    Fast --> Search["Shared SearchService"]
    Advanced --> Search
    Search --> Registry["Pinned active index/generation/manifest checks"]
    Search --> Encoder["Preloaded paired CLIP runtime, bounded inference slot"]
    Encoder --> Decoder["Query decoder process: same Phase 04 preprocessing"]
    Search --> Vector["Qdrant adapter: bounded query_points"]
    Vector --> Fusion["UUID union, RRF / weighted score"]
    Fusion --> Metadata["Batch PG ready receipts, metadata và tags"]
    Metadata --> Gate["Required AND/OR tri-state evidence gate"]
    Gate --> Rerank["Optional lightweight reranker / explicit fallback"]
    Rerank --> Delivery["Object existence checks, stable Top-K response"]
    Delivery --> ObjectPort["Private MinIO adapter"]
    Routes --> Content["Authenticated content proxy"]
    Content --> ObjectPort
    Delivery --> Metrics["Bounded full-response telemetry, không query text"]
    Future["RAG / Agent / multi-hop: chưa triển khai, ngoài fast path"]
